vendor-neutral honeypot / deception evaluation framework (UHQS).

Signed-off-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
 README.md | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 49a7bae..f6cab3f 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -576,6 +576,7 @@ Discover more awesome lists at [sindresorhus/awesome](https://github.com/sindres
 - [T-Pot: A Multi-Honeypot Platform](https://dtag-dev-sec.github.io/mediator/feature/2015/03/17/concept.html)
 - [Honeypot (Dionaea and kippo) setup script](https://github.com/andrewmichaelsmith/honeypot-setup-script/)
 - [The Security Canary Maturity Model](https://tracebit.com/blog/the-security-canary-maturity-model)
+- [UHBS](https://github.com/uhbs/uhbs-standard) - Open-source Universal Honeypot Benchmarking Standard for vendor-neutral honeypot and deception evaluation (UHQS scoring).
 
 - Deployment
 
